{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55213","headline":"破法身见颂 · 智闲","name":"破法身见颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向上无父娘，向下无男女。\n独自一个身，切须了却去。\n闻我有此言，人人竞来取。\n对他一句子，不话无言语。\n（以上六首均见《景德传灯录》卷二十九。\n）（按：敦煌遗书斯五五五八卷收「龙兴寺香严和尚《嗟世三伤吟》」，存二首。\n《监诫录》卷十收伏牛上人〖即自在〗《三伤颂》，其前二首与敦煌本大致相同。\n详《全唐诗外编》〖修订本〗，兹不重收。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智闲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}